### 5. Cross-Chain Lending Pattern (OTD→DTO) ⭐⭐

**Source:** Cross-Chain Lending Protocol article

For future expansion to true cross-chain yield optimization.

```
Architecture:
┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐
│   Origin Chain  │         │  Destination    │
│   (Ethereum)    │         │  Chain (L2)     │
│   - Deposits    │         │  - Lending Pool │
└────────┬────────┘         └────────┬────────┘
         │                           │
